    "Dive %@, %@" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver label for a dive entry. First argument is the dive number (e.g. 1140), second is the site name.\nVoiceOver screen-change announcement when navigating to a dive. First argument is the dive number (e.g. 1140), second is the site name.",
